# The only Docker build using the repository root as its context is the local
# performance-server image. Keep the 49+ GB working tree, client releases,
# build outputs and test data out of BuildKit; the image only consumes these
# two paths.
**
!deploy/
!deploy/mosu/
!deploy/mosu/deploy/
!deploy/mosu/deploy/performance.Dockerfile
!artifacts/
!artifacts/performance-publish/
!artifacts/performance-publish/**
